  "releaseNotes": "refactor(core): adopt IUtf8SpanFormattable and streamline generic UTF-8 formatting\n\n      - Migrate from static Utf8Formatter to generic IUtf8SpanFormattable in Buffer\n      - Consolidate primitive number formatting overloads into a single generic method\n      - Relocate boolean text formatting from Buffer to Utf8Builder to preserve layer boundaries\n      - Resolve overload resolution ambiguity between raw binary bytes and formatted values\n      - Standardize unit tests for .NET 9 format specifications (TimeSpan, float, control chars)\n      - Benchmark shows 20-40% throughput improvement with strict zero-allocation across all types",
